  Grant comes from cwd `ooda.pkg` `caps`. Need comes from the lock line.
  `pm_caps_ok` accepts the child mask only when it is a subset of the parent.
  Worktree `ooda.pkg` grant is `FsRead`. The new fixture must not ask for extra caps.
  Public `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/registry/hello/hello.oo` has `hello_ok` only.
  It has no `pub fn main`. Do not change it. Do not treat `hello_ok` as a program.
